              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Soua Lee"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Exactly the kind of cake I was looking for! I used 3/4 cup of oil and half a stick of butter. I also added a 1/4 cup of brown sugar. I baked it in 4 5x3 rectangular glass containers for 50 minutes. Enjoyed without any frosting. Yum.",
            "datePublished": "2020-06-07T04:45:20.913Z"
