            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Marlene Louise Burdick-Martin"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Am always trying to add protein &amp; fiber into my baked goods while reducing oils &amp; sugar. Changes made: 2c flour--- 1/2c lentil-rice flour, 1/2 c ww, 1/4 Urad flour, 3/4c all purp 1 1/3c sugar 1/2c olive oil 1/2c pear sauce 1/2c dark choc chips 1t vanilla&amp; no cinnamon Fabulous! Will go into regular rotation!",
